{
  "name": "[Stock] Phone Booking - 1. Inbound IVR",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stage 1: Inbound IVR\nTwilio's Voice webhook for the client's number points at the \"Inbound Call\" webhook below.\n\nFlow:\n1. Call arrives -> greeting + Gather (Press 1 / Press 2)\n2. Twilio POSTs the pressed digit to \"Gather Result\"\n3. Digit 1 -> <Dial> straight to reception (pure Twilio forwarding, no AI)\n4. Digit 2 -> <Dial><Sip> handoff to the Vapi assistant (see README for Vapi SIP Trunking setup)\n\nSet the Twilio number's Voice webhook (in the Twilio Console, or via the Twilio node) to:\nhttps://keystoneconsultancy.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/twilio/inbound-call",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "ivr-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -900,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "twilio/inbound-call",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-inbound-call",
      "name": "Inbound Call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -900,
        140
      ],
      "webhookId": "twilio-inbound-call"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_CONFIG_WORKFLOW_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "exec-client-config-1",
      "name": "Get Client Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -660,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "greeting-twiml",
              "name": "twiml",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<Response>\n  <Gather numDigits=\"1\" timeout=\"6\" action=\"https://keystoneconsultancy.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/twilio/gather-result\" method=\"POST\">\n    <Say voice=\"Polly.Joanna\">Thanks for calling {{ $json.businessName }}. Press 1 for general enquiries. Press 2 to book an appointment.</Say>\n  </Gather>\n  <Say voice=\"Polly.Joanna\">Sorry, we didn't get your response. Goodbye.</Say>\n</Response>"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-greeting-twiml",
      "name": "Build Greeting TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -420,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json.twiml }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/xml"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-greeting",
      "name": "Return Greeting TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        -180,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "twilio/gather-result",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-gather-result",
      "name": "Gather Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -900,
        480
      ],
      "webhookId": "twilio-gather-result"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_CONFIG_WORKFLOW_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "exec-client-config-2",
      "name": "Get Client Config1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -660,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "merge-digits",
              "name": "digits",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Gather Result').item.json.body.Digits }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "merge-from",
              "name": "callerNumber",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Gather Result').item.json.body.From }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "merge-to",
              "name": "calledNumber",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Gather Result').item.json.body.To }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-merge-context",
      "name": "Merge Call Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -420,
        480
      ],
      "notes": "Combines the Client Config output with the caller's raw Twilio params (available via $('Gather Result')) since Execute Workflow replaces the item's json."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.digits }}",
                    "rightValue": "1",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Press 1 - Reception"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.digits }}",
                    "rightValue": "2",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Press 2 - AI Booking"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "id": "switch-digit",
      "name": "Route On Digit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "forward-twiml",
              "name": "twiml",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<Response>\n  <Say voice=\"Polly.Joanna\">Connecting you now.</Say>\n  <Dial>{{ $json.receptionForwardNumber }}</Dial>\n</Response>"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-forward-twiml",
      "name": "Build Forward-To-Reception TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        80,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "vapi-twiml",
              "name": "twiml",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<Response>\n  <Dial answerOnBridge=\"true\" action=\"https://keystoneconsultancy.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/twilio/vapi-dial-status\" method=\"POST\">\n    <Sip>\n      sip:{{ $json.calledNumber }}@{{ $json.vapiSipCredentialId }}.{{ $json.vapiSipRegionHost }}\n      <Parameter name=\"clientId\" value=\"{{ $json.clientId }}\" />\n      <Parameter name=\"callerNumber\" value=\"{{ $json.callerNumber }}\" />\n    </Sip>\n  </Dial>\n</Response>"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-vapi-twiml",
      "name": "Build Vapi Handoff TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        80,
        480
      ],
      "notes": "REQUIRES VALIDATION IN TESTING: dynamic <Dial><Sip> handoff mid-call to Vapi's SIP trunking URI. Set up the SIP trunking phone number + credential in the Vapi dashboard first (see README). The Dial's action callback (Dial Status Callback node below) catches a failed handoff (busy/no-answer/failed/canceled) and falls back to forwarding the caller to reception instead of dropping the call, plus emails the business with the specific DialCallStatus so a failure is never silent."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fallback-twiml",
              "name": "twiml",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<Response>\n  <Say voice=\"Polly.Joanna\">Sorry, I didn't get a valid response. Goodbye.</Say>\n</Response>"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-fallback-twiml",
      "name": "Build Fallback TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        80,
        660
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json.twiml }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/xml"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-routed",
      "name": "Return Routed TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        340,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SIP Handoff Failure Handling\nTwilio calls this back automatically after the Vapi <Dial> leg ends, whatever the outcome (DialCallStatus: completed / busy / no-answer / failed / canceled).\n\n- completed -> the call already ended normally (Vapi/caller hung up); just acknowledge, no further TwiML has any effect.\n- anything else -> the SIP handoff itself failed to connect. The caller is still on the line waiting, so we recover instead of dropping them: forward to reception, and email the business immediately with the exact DialCallStatus + CallSid so a failure is never silent or vague.\n\nThis is the fallback + logging asked for around the SIP handoff risk - it does not remove the risk itself (still unverified against a real call), it just makes a failure recoverable and visible instead of a dropped call with no trace.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "dial-status-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -900,
        820
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "twilio/vapi-dial-status",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-dial-status",
      "name": "Dial Status Callback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -900,
        1000
      ],
      "webhookId": "twilio-vapi-dial-status"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $json.body || {};\nreturn [{ json: {\n  dialCallStatus: body.DialCallStatus || 'unknown',\n  dialCallDuration: body.DialCallDuration || null,\n  callSid: body.CallSid || null,\n  callerNumber: body.From || null,\n  calledNumber: body.To || null,\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "code-parse-dial-status",
      "name": "Parse Dial Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -660,
        1000
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_CONFIG_WORKFLOW_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "exec-client-config-3",
      "name": "Get Client Config2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -420,
        1000
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const config = $input.item.json;\nconst status = $('Parse Dial Status').item.json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...status, ...config } }];"
      },
      "id": "code-merge-dial-status",
      "name": "Merge Dial Status Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -180,
        1000
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.dialCallStatus }}",
              "rightValue": "completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-handoff-ok",
      "name": "Was Handoff Successful?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        60,
        1000
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: { twiml: '<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?><Response></Response>' } }];"
      },
      "id": "code-ack-completed",
      "name": "Build Empty Ack TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        300,
        900
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const d = $input.item.json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ...d,\n  twiml: `<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\\n<Response>\\n  <Say voice=\"Polly.Joanna\">Sorry, I'm having trouble connecting you to booking right now. Let me put you through to the team instead.</Say>\\n  <Dial>${d.receptionForwardNumber}</Dial>\\n</Response>`,\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "code-fallback-twiml",
      "name": "Build SIP-Failure Fallback TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        300,
        1100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.resend.com/emails",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ from: $json.confirmationFromEmail, to: [$json.businessNotificationEmail], subject: `AI booking line failed to connect - ${$json.dialCallStatus}`, text: `The Vapi SIP handoff failed on an inbound call and the caller was forwarded to reception as a fallback.\\n\\nDialCallStatus: ${$json.dialCallStatus}\\nCallSid: ${$json.callSid}\\nCaller: ${$json.callerNumber}\\nCalled number: ${$json.calledNumber}\\nDial duration: ${$json.dialCallDuration}\\n\\nCheck the Vapi SIP trunking config and n8n execution logs for this CallSid if this keeps happening.` }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "http-notify-handoff-failure",
      "name": "Notify Business Of Failed Handoff",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        540,
        1100
      ],
      "notes": "Resend API - POST /emails. Uses the 'Header Auth account 2' credential (header Authorization: Bearer <resend-api-key>). onError continues regardless - the caller must still get the fallback TwiML even if this notification itself fails to send.",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "YHY8OwE9VDR10sYO",
          "name": "Header Auth account 2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: { twiml: $('Build SIP-Failure Fallback TwiML').item.json.twiml } }];"
      },
      "id": "code-restore-fallback-twiml",
      "name": "Restore Fallback TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        1100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json.twiml }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Content-Type",
                "value": "text/xml"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-dial-status",
      "name": "Return Dial Status TwiML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        780,
        1000
      ]
    }
  ],
